{"4961110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEVER TURN BACK", "steam_appid": 4961110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside a dark, seemingly endless tunnel with no memory of how you got there. The only way forward is through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the tunnel for essential supplies, manage your limited resources, and stay alert as unsettling sounds echo through the endless corridors. Every step brings new tension, and something unseen is always close behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the tunnel reveals its terrifying secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense first-person psychological horror experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark and mysterious underground tunnel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to survive your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your food and water while searching for the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere with dynamic lighting and unsettling sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relentless presence that never lets you feel safe.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside a dark, seemingly endless tunnel with no memory of how you got there. The only way forward is through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the tunnel for essential supplies, manage your limited resources, and stay alert as unsettling sounds echo through the endless corridors. Every step brings new tension, and something unseen is always close behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the tunnel reveals its terrifying secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\